OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 18 MAY
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Palestrina
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod invites you to
OL,6,     GRenaissance Rome, starting in a
OL,7,     Gsmall town outside of the Eternal
OL,8,     GCity, where our investigation
OL,9,     Ginto the origins of Giovanni da
OL,10,     GPalestrina begins...
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GCaroline Shaw and Andrew Yee
OL,13,     Gperform from their new album Or,
OL,14,     GThe Whale.
OL,15,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,16,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,17,     Gsoundscape of classical music,
OL,18,     Gwith works by Takashi Yoshimatsu,
OL,19,     GMadeleine Dring and John Rutter.
