OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 18 MAY
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GTchaikovsky juggles beauty and
OL,6,     Gsuffering, Benjamin Britten
OL,7,     Greflects powerfully on grief and
OL,8,     Gconflict, and Leonard Bernstein
OL,9,     Ggrapples with the modern world.
OL,10,G2145FThe Essay: Full Moon on Progress
OL,11,     FSt
OL,12,     GDr Rommi Smith examines a turning-
OL,13,     Gpoint moment in the life of five
OL,14,     GBlack female musicians, revealing
OL,15,     Glesser-known aspects of their
OL,16,     Glife and work, going behind
OL,17,     Gstereotypes.
